    """Apply a manual application override to a selection of rules.

    Body: ``{"rule_hashes": [...], "application": "any"}``. Today only ``"any"``
    is supported as a literal application override - anything else (a real
    app name) would need to be validated against the live catalog, and the
    use case for that lives in the per-row inline editor, not in bulk apply.
    Writes ``source='manual'`` so the global auto-assign won't overwrite."""
